      "If the church is Christ's assembly, seated with him and joined to him as his body, what is it actually meant to do on a Tuesday? Jesus answered before he ascended: “All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth. Go ye therefore, and teach all nations… teaching them to observe all things whatsoever I have commanded you: and, lo, I am with you alway” (Matt 28:18-20). The authority is his. The going is ours. The presence is his again.",
