      "It is also a pattern of <strong>ordinary</strong> faithfulness. Most of the kingdom's work is done by people whose names no one will remember: parents raising children in love, nurses on night shift, workers who refuse to cheat, neighbours who bring meals, intercessors who pray in secret (Matt 6:6). Jesus said the kingdom belongs to the poor in spirit and the meek (Matt 5:3, 5). Reigning with him is less about spectacle than about faithfulness.",
