      "<strong>The test.</strong> Ask whether a kingdom programme makes believers better servants of their neighbours, including neighbours of other faiths and none, or whether it makes them rivals for control. Daniel served Babylon faithfully for decades without trying to seize it, and God honoured him there (Dan 1:19-21; 6:3)."
