    reads: "Psalm 110 and 1 Corinthians 15:25 are read as a mandate for believers to take dominion over nations and institutions so that Christ's enemies are subdued; Acts 3:21 means Christ cannot return until the church has taken over. Some versions add apostolic hierarchies and spiritual warfare aimed at political outcomes. Genesis 1:28 is read as a mandate to rule society, not only to tend creation.",
